        "original_id": "8e664458-ba40-5f6e-868f-df000ffae82c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Wyndorf, Poly Styrene, Marianne Joan Elliott-Said\n- Bands and Releases: Monster Magnet, X-Ray Spex, Love Monster\n- Roles: songwriter, lead vocalist, guitarist, frontwoman, musician, singer-songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Wyndorf was born as David Albert Wyndorf on October 28, 1956.\n- Poly Styrene was born as Marianne Joan Elliott-Said on 3 July 1957.\n- In 1988, Dave Wyndorf recorded all songs on the EP Love Monster a year before Monster Magnet was formed.\n- Dave Wyndorf is the songwriter, lead vocalist, and a guitarist for the American rock group Monster Magnet.\n- Poly Styrene, the stage name of Marianne Joan Elliott-Said, was a British musician, singer-songwriter, and frontwoman for the punk rock band X-Ray Spex.\n- Poly Styrene died on 25 April 2011.\n- Love Monster is an EP released by Monster Magnet.",
